{"3442410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Real Time Chess Roguelike", "steam_appid": 3442410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an army of familiar chess pieces in a single player campaign. There are no turns, instead each piece goes on cooldown after moving. Win by capturing the enemy king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between battles there is a shop that sells more pieces to strengthen or replace your army.<br><br>Various upgrades such as increased movement, additional directions, shields, cooldown, economy etc. allows for customization of your army.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an army of familiar chess pieces in a single player campaign. There are no turns, instead each piece goes on cooldown after moving. Win by capturing the enemy king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between battles there is a shop that sells more pieces to strengthen or replace your army.<br><br>Various upgrades such as increased movement, additional directions, shields, cooldown, economy etc. allows for customization of your army.</p>", "short_description": "Chess, but instead of taking turns each piece has an individual cooldown. Additional pieces and upgrades can be bought after each battle in the campaign.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442410/f244e58032bcec26894a2ddcd340df1661c4c7e7/header.jpg?t=1784550066", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442410/b47650fb299f3d3fe2b27b23c218f85f073b56a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784550066", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442410/b47650fb299f3d3fe2b27b23c218f85f073b56a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784550066", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</st